window.products.push({"id":1105373,"name":"b.b.begonia Go with the Flow Reusable Shopping Bag, Set of 5 Assorted Designs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81i-+WRuXaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"\"Go green\" without sacrificing style. b.b.begonia bags are known for their exclusive, eye-catching prints, that run the gamut from fashionably subtle to a riot of colorful blooms. While lovely to look at, b.b. begonia bags are designed with function in mind; each bag will hold the equivalent of 2 standard grocery bags - about 45-pound. When empty, a b.b. begonia bag rolls up to a compact, 1 by 4-inch size weighing only 1.4-ounce; just right for tucking into a handbag or pocket. b.b. begonia shopping bags are made from an extremely durable, fade-resistant 100-percent polyester fabric, which has a wonderfully soft hand-feel. Double-layered handles, contrast facings, French-seaming and bar-tack stitching at critical stress-points are just some of the ways that b.b. begonia reusable bags are a cut above the rest. Showing that you care about the environment can be as simple as using a beautiful, reusable bag. By eliminating the plastic bags that choke our rivers, litter our green-spaces and clog our landfills, we take steps that will beautify our communities and improve the eco-health of our surroundings. Using b.b. begonia bags is a truly pleasurable experience for the eco-conscious shopper.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81i-+WRuXaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"b.b.begonia","source_asin":"B003UERZNI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1105373","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003UERZNI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003UERZNI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1105374,"name":"ROKUSHIRO Petty Knife 5.3-Inch (135mm), 37-Layer VG10 Damascus Hammered Kitchen Chef Knife, High Carbon Stainless Steel Forged Blade","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":84.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716Hj2JzoGS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FULL TANG PETTY KNIFE FOR FINE CUTTING – Compared to a paring knife, the 5.3-Inch (135 mm) Japanese Petty knife includes a sharp point for piercing and a smaller blade for smaller, finer cuts involving delicate produce and herbs, small fruits and vegetables. EXCEPTIONAL FORGED CONSTRUCTION – Core is premium VG-10 cobalt alloy steel (VG10). Outer material high carbon stainless steel. 37-layered hammered Damascus finish. 2mm thickness. Rockwell Hardness HR58 ± 1. Made by hand in Japan by skilled artisans. AMAZING SHARPNESS FROM DAY ONE, WITH AN EVEN EDGE – Each knife is hand-sharpened before leaving the factory, with the ultra-sharp double-beveled edge suitable for right-handed or left-handed chefs at home or in restaurants. BEST IN COMFORT - Ergonomic handle is extremely durable with an ideal, balanced fit to the hand for perfect control. Multi-laminate construction will last for years to come. HEIRLOOM-WORTH QUALITY WITH UNMATCHED CRAFTSMANSHIP AND PRECISION – Pride of ownership comes with Rokushiro knives, and with proper usage and care this Japanese masterpiece knife will last a lifetime.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716Hj2JzoGS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ROKUSHIRO","source_asin":"B09VLLDT2C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1105374","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VLLDT2C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VLLDT2C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
