window.products.push({"id":1105382,"name":"Eddie Bauer - Daybed Set, Reversible Cotton Bedding with Matching Shams & Decorative Pillow Cover, Lightweight Home Decor for All Seasons (Arrowhead C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":72.37,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91aqpk1GPKS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Eddie Bauer's best-selling Arrowhead Quilt Set is now available in a daybed set. This convenient set is perfect for your guest room or kids room - with a daybed cover, two standard shams and a decorative pillow cover included. Just add sheets and your ensemble is complete- (your favorite Eddie Bauer Sheet Sets are sold separately). Pillow inserts are not included. Daybed face, shams and pillow cover are constructed with 100% quality cotton and the daybed reverse is polyester, for extra coziness. Quilting fill is a blend of 80% cotton/20% polyester for warmth without the added weight. Set is machine washable for easy care.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91aqpk1GPKS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eddie Bauer","source_asin":"B0BVQRD919","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1105382","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVQRD919","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVQRD919","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1105383,"name":"Coffee Mug Warmer with Auto Shut Off Timer, Mug Warmer & Coffee Warmer for Desk with Auto On/Off, Smart Coffee Cup Warmer with 3 Temperature Settings,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510XoD6Q7yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Auto on/off -- The mug warmer has a gravity sensor. No need turn it on/off manually. After you plug it in and press the switch, the coffee warmer will automatically turn on/off when you put on/off the cup. When you remove the cup, the heater goes into standby. If the cup is not put back within 10 minutes, the coffee mug warmer will automatically shut down for safety. In addition, the weight of the cup and water exceeds 10.5oz(300g) to trigger the gravity sensor. Auto Shut off Timer -- In order to prevent the danger caused by forgetting to take down the cup, our coffee cup warmer has additionally added a timer shutdown function. After pressing the timer button, you can choose how many hours between 2-12(2H, 4H, 6H, 8H, 10H, 12H) the mug warmer will automatically shut down after continuous work. If you don't adjust it, the coffee warmer will automatically shut down after 4 hours of continuous work by default. 3 Temperature Settings -- Our coffee warmer for desk keeps your beverages at the temperature you want. After pressing the power button, the coffee cup warmer for desk defaults to the high temperature 149℉- 170℉. You can choose temperature between 130℉(104℉-130℉), 150℉(131℉-150℉) and 170℉(149℉-170℉) through touching the button. Digital TEM/TIME Display -- We have additionally added a digital display for our coffee warmer to show the temperature and timing time of your choice. Please note that it can't display temperature and time in real time. For Most Mugs -- Whether the bottom of the cup is flat or not, our mug warmer for desk can play a good insulation effect. The diameter of the heating plate is 3.75in fitting more cups. For your safety, please do not use heat-labile containers such as paper and plastic cups. Safe & Durable -- length: 5.9”, width: 4.7”. Length of the cord: 60”. The bottom and sides of the mug warmer are made of heat-resistant material, so you don't have to worry about burning your hands and damaging the table. The waterproof and heat-resistant material makes the coffee cup warmer more secure and durable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510XoD6Q7yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ISUMER","source_asin":"B0C7B2XBWD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1105383","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7B2XBWD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C7B2XBWD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
