window.products.push({"id":1105402,"name":"Rusticity® Wooden Serving Tray for Dining/Breakfast/Coffee Table - Metal Handle - Large | Handmade | (17x11 in)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61h71j9O0CL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"When it comes to essentials, one barely has time to pay attention to details. However, that shouldn’t stop you from decorating your home with items which hold great utility but also comes with an aesthetically pleasing design. The Rusticity Wooden Dining and Breakfast Serving Tray Collection consists of an array of designs which can be perfect accents to any style of home and kitchen decor. Handmade from natural wood, they come in a variety of sizes and designs, from rustic to modern, from metal embellishments and leather decorations to plain wooden textures and half-finished charms. The serving trays are useful for serving breakfast, at dining tables, coffee tables, etc. Interestingly, they can also be used in your workspace as trays for office documents, files, mail, stationery - to hold and arrange your desk accessories. Rusticity stands for the quality of being rustic. We are an international brand of traditional products handcrafted for modern use. Our products are created to add a traditional rustic flavor to your lives at the same time creating modern usability and value. All our products are sourced in a fair and responsible manner and provide some highly needed support to these traditional arts and crafts that are dying. *Since these are handcrafted, each individual unit may vary slightly from each other","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61h71j9O0CL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rusticity","source_asin":"B01N7XLKWH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1105402","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N7XLKWH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N7XLKWH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
