window.products.push({"id":1105435,"name":"Grandoh Stainless Steel Paper Towel Holder Stand | 13 x 7.5 Inch Innovative Paper Towel Dispenser Countertop Allows You to Tear A Sheet with One Hand ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.11,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DC6BZeo3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"➤ Wouldn’t it be great if you could quickly tear a single paper towel sheet with only one hand?➤ Are you sick and tired of kitchen accessories that might be practical and useful but are not pretty to look at? If either of those questions has you nodding your head in agreement, then you’re going to love this Stainless Steel Paper Towel Holder Stand! Wall mounted paper towel holders are old news. They get the job done but they’re not very versatile. Once you install them, there’s no turning back. We got tired of seeing other freestanding paper towel holders that were made out of cheap materials and poorly designed.Instead of complaining about it, we decided to design a new and improved one. We wanted a paper towel dispenser that was the perfect combination of style and functionality. One that when you use it for the first time you say, “Wow, I can’t believe I used a different kind for all of these years.” It took months of research, design, and trial/error but we finally nailed it. The result is the paper towel holder you see in front of you. It’s everything you could possibly want in a kitchen accessory and so much more. Product Features & Benefits: ✅ Measures 13 x 7.5 inches ✅ Made from premium stainless steel ✅ Tear a sheet with only one hand ✅ Spring loaded arm holds all towel brands ✅ Weighted, non-slip base ✅ Looks great when put on display ✅ Makes a great gift idea You’ll Love It Or You Don’t Owe Us A Dime We’ll make you a promise, give this paper towel holder a try for 30 days. If you’re not convinced that this is the best dispenser that you’ve ever had, we’ll take it back for a full refund. No hassle and no questions asked. That’s how confident we are that it is the best one on the market. And you will think so too.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DC6BZeo3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"grandoh","source_asin":"B08SGGNBB9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1105435","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SGGNBB9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SGGNBB9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1105436,"name":"Richards Homewares Natural Wood Trouser/Skirt Clamp Hanger","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":4.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61a1n4RHrPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These Wood Clamp Hangers are an elegant and simple solution for convenient storage and organization of all your pants or skirts. This trouser clamp hanger is a handy closet accessory that will help keep your closet and growing wardrobe organized tidy and manageable. Natural Wood Pants Hanger Features 11\" wide natural wood clamps. Sleek chrome accents including 360° swivel hanging hook. Clamps have soft felt lining to securely grip even delicate garments. Skirt hanger snaps closed and locks into place for reliable hanging storage. Wood features a beautiful lacquered natural finish. Wooden clothing hanger is perfect for organizing everything from business slacks and golf pants to jeans and skirts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61a1n4RHrPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Richards","source_asin":"B0002I5X8O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1105436","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0002I5X8O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0002I5X8O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
