window.products.push({"id":1105710,"name":"9\" 100PCS Air Fryer Disposable Paper Liners, 100Pcs Non-stick Air Fryer Liner, Airfryer Parchment Paper Liners Sheets for Air Fryer Basket Accessories","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ibtEn-c7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"■ Keep Your Air Fryer Clean and Durable ■ Our air fryer disposable paper liner can effectively keep food residue away from the fryer and make it as clean as unused, saving time and effort. And, Prolong the service life of the air fryer. If you hate cleaning after baking, our air fryer disposable paper liner is your best kitchen assistant. ■ Healthy and Tasty ■ Our air fryer parchment paper is made of food-grade parchment and is waterproof, grease-proof, non-sticky, and heat-resistant up to 500°F (428°F recommended). Unlike air fryer liners with holes, our liners won't let oil flow out and soil the fryer, and they won't affect the taste of your food. ■ Easy to Use ■ Our air fryer disposable paper liners have a round bowl shape that requires no tearing, folding, cutting, or bending. Simply place them in your fryer when you're ready to cook. With a height edge of 1.8 inches, our liners protect the side of the fryer and prevent food from sticking, without affecting air circulation. ■ Widely Used ■ Our air fryer parchment paper is suitable for use in air fryers, microwaves, ovens, steamers, cookers, and more. They can be used for baking, roasting, frying, or serving food, making them ideal for home baking, camping, BBQs, summer parties, and more. ■ Buying Guide ■ Our air fryer liners come in three sizes: 6.3\" for 3.7qt air fryers (suitable for 2-3 people), 7.9\" for 5.8qt and larger air fryers, and 9\" for 6-10qt and larger air fryers (suitable for 4-8 people). Please choose the size that matches your air fryer basket's bottom width. ■ Attention ■ To prevent the air fryer liners from flying away or burning, make sure your food is evenly and completely placed on top of them. Do not put the liners in the fryer when preheating.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ibtEn-c7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BOXTOHEART","source_asin":"B09Q1HM227","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1105710","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q1HM227","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q1HM227","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
