window.products.push({"id":1105737,"name":"Metal Wall Art Modernist Iron Wall Decor Silver and Gold Modernist Floating Circles Crinkle Hand Cast Abstract Geometric Decoration for Porch,Room,Liv","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8184yXUu2zS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Package:2 pcs floating wall arts.Each overall size: 29.5 in * 20.85 in * 0.78in Sculptural art for your spaces.Add depth and dimension to your space with the Modernist Floating Circles. Contrasting discs of gold, silver pewter are placed on intersecting metal rods together and make for eye-catching wall art that can be hung both vertically or horizontally . Artisan hand made Crafted from the highest quality iron and special finishes, hang this versatile modern art behind a couch or above a bed for a dramatic statement.Given the handcrafted nature of this artwork, each piece will be unique. Decorate any room fine and easily, this sculpture pairs with a variety of color pallets and design themes. An ideal gift: it's a perfect gift when holidays, birthdays, weddings ect. Also a good decoration for room, restuarant,hotel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8184yXUu2zS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HongRui","source_asin":"B08YMYM5F2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1105737","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YMYM5F2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YMYM5F2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1105738,"name":"Organic French Lavender Dried Lavander Buds - 1 Pound - Dry Flowers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31fmmRHmt7L._AC_.jpg","description":"Plant overview Many people appreciate lavender (Lavandula angustifolia) for its aromatic fragrance, used in soaps, shampoos, and sachets for scenting clothes. The name lavender comes from the Latin root lavare, which means \"to wash.\" Lavender most likely earned this name because it was frequently used in baths to help purify the body and spirit. However, this herb is also considered a natural remedy for a range of ailments from insomnia and anxiety to depression and mood disturbances. Recent studies bear out years of anecdotal evidence showing that lavender produces calming, soothing, and sedative effects. Insomnia in folklore, pillows were filled with lavender flowers to help the restless fall sleep. There is now scientific evidence to suggest that aromatherapy with lavender slows the activity of the nervous system, improves sleep quality, promotes relaxation, and lifts mood in people suffering from sleep disorders. Studies also suggest that massage with essential oils, particularly lavender, may result in improved sleep quality, more stable mood, increased mental capacity, and reduced anxiety. In one recent study, participants who received massage with lavender felt less anxious and more positive than participants who received massage alone. Lavender flowers have also been approved by the Commission E in Germany as a tea for insomnia, restlessness, and nervous stomach irritations. Aromatherapy Aromatherapists also use lavender as a tonic in inhalation therapy to treat headaches, nervous disorders, and exhaustion. Herbalists treat skin ailments, such as fungal infections (like candidiasis), wounds, eczema, and acne, with lavender oil. It is also used externally in a healing bath for circulatory disorders and as a rub for rheumatic ailments (conditions affecting the muscles and joints).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31fmmRHmt7L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Teliagifts","source_asin":"B005LFML6K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1105738","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005LFML6K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005LFML6K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1105739,"name":"NICETOWN Taupe Kitchen Valances Half Curtains - Pocket Top 18\" L Semi Sheer Window Treatment Tiers Linen Blend Texture for Flat Bedroom/Kids Room, 52\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514We1gMUCL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Polyester Imported SOFT TO TOUCH: Woven from a special fabric, our linen textile curtains make your room elegant and luxury. Not only soft to touch, but also maintain drape and no wrinkles. GOOD PERFORMANCE: Unlike ordinary sheer drapes, the weave in the fabric is not too sheer, which creates a non-transparent view but still lets enough light in during the day. WIDE COMPATIBILITY: The sheer not only can be hung alone for simplicity but also can match with blackout curtains for a stylish and lively appearance which you can find in the NICETOWN store. EASY TO CARE: Machine washable in cold water ( make sure the water temperature is lower than 87℉ ), tumble dry, quick iron or steam clean when it is necessary. Easy use of easy care.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514We1gMUCL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NICETOWN","source_asin":"B07RP6BTDY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1105739","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RP6BTDY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RP6BTDY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1105740,"name":"QRP AIRTIGHT WIDE MOUTH SEALS for Mason Jars Reusable Food Grade Silicone STAY PUT INSIDE the Lid (14-3\" WIDE MOUTH)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618kx9onZ-L._AC_SL1032_.jpg","description":"QUALITY RELIABLE PRODUCTS REUSABLE SILICONE SEALS STAY PUT. They are designed wide enough that they seat firmly against the roof of any brand Mason jar plastic cap completely underneath the threads and cannot fall out while screwing the lid onto or off the jar. They are GUARANTEED to provide an airtight and leak-proof seal. We tried the narrower red rubber seals with the smaller outer diameter. They tend to become displaced while tightening the lid, and unfortunately, they did not keep our fermentation jars airtight (see photo). QRP SEALS provide a perfect airtight, anaerobic enclosure while fermenting Kimchi (vegetables) or Kombucha (tea). We ferment on a very large scale, and QRP SEALS do resolve the airtight issue. When testing QRP SEALS by placing water in a jar and shaking the jar, we experience no leaks. We understand your health concerns. QRP products were developed to help our director overcome prostate cancer. ALL QRP products are made from USDA Food Grade BPA-free Compliant Silicone and are produced by a reputable food container manufacturer for food products only. CAUTION: OVERTIGHTENING COULD DAMAGE THE SEAL AND MAKE IT DIFFICULT TO REMOVE THE CAP! QRP SEALS HAVE NO TAB AND ARE NOT A GOOD FIT FOR GLASS STORAGE CONTAINERS. 2021 Quality Reliable Products, All Rights Reserved.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618kx9onZ-L._AC_SL1032_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Quality Reliable Products","source_asin":"B06WCZHFMD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1105740","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06WCZHFMD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06WCZHFMD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
