window.products.push({"id":1105922,"name":"Nambe Cortina Hinged Candelabra","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61n--Q4zFeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Six taped candles glowing on two separate levels atop your dining room table for a romantic evening. The Cortina Candelabra is a beautiful with a unique, modern design that cannot be found elsewhere. The Cortina Hinged Candelabra is a literal twist on a classic candelabra. Holding 6 candles, you can turn the hinges for a variety of different shapes and appearances. Customize it to accommodate any table or aesthetic in your home. Less than ten years after opening his studio in New York, Karim Rashid stands among the contemporary masters of design. Rashid works in architecture, interiors, fashion and furniture. He is also a sculptor, painter and ceramist with a number of prestigious one-man shows and exhibits to his credit. Recognized for its award-winning designs for more than 60 years, Nambes commitment to timeless beauty, artistic integrity and uncompromising quality is evident in the brands collection of serve ware, barware, home dcor and gift items. Nambe collaborates with the worlds most esteemed designers to develop products that bring function and style into the home. Package contains (1) Nambe Gift Collection Cortina Hinged Candelabra. Made of Namb Alloy. Care instructions: Hard wash; dry immediately. Designed by Karim Rashid in 2017.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61n--Q4zFeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"nambe","source_asin":"B07F1YS1PM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1105922","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07F1YS1PM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07F1YS1PM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
