window.products.push({"id":1105940,"name":"Electric Blender Fruit Cups Personal Blender Juicers Portable Blender Mini Blender Easy to Clean USB Rechargeable Gifts for Travel Camping Office Kitc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51chDlMggrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"2019 Year new generation personal blender portable juicer gift for women babies elder vegetables fruit smoothies smart blender food processor at home office or travel conveniently, with filter layer and handle. Wireless portable blender can be as water bottle, fruits and vegetables juicer, jam, shakes and smoothies maker, which allows you enjoy fresh nutrient retention and wonderful leisure time wherever you work, sport, hike, drive, travel, wild camping, picnic.  Material: food grade PC Blade Material: stainless steel Blades: six powerful motor blades in 3d for superb mixing Available Storage Capacity: 300ml (10oz)  Juicer Cup Net Weight: 420g (0.93lb)  Size: 81*81*240mm (3.19*3.19*9.45inch)  Charging: Universal Micro USB rechargeable durable battery Universal Fast Charging Port: 5V/1.5A Built-in Battery: 4.2V 2000mAh Motor Specification: DC 7.4V Evolving Speed Idling Condition:22000R/min, 35s to stop, load Condition:15000R/min Operating Current: 10A-15A Protective Function: idling 10s to stop. Loading normal 80s stop.  Package Included:  1*Personal Blender 1* Universal Micro USB Charging Cable 1*User Manual How to use:  1. Prepare the fruit you like, remove useless hard core, cut them into 1.5*1.5cm. 2. Place fruit up to 60%, add water or milk make them total lower than 80% of the bottle. 3. Press the button. It takes about 0.5-1.5 minutes for tasty juice base on the softness of fruit. Upside down the machine so that the blades can start to run, then you can turn it back, shake a few seconds to become more delicious.  4. Turn off to enjoy the fresh and healthy drink. Tips:  1. No work, insufficient battery power, please charge about 3 hours with usb cable.  2. Stop work, reset power button. It is better to add some water or milk, too much or big fruit pieces or without water may get blades stuck.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51chDlMggrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Votobo","source_asin":"B07HVWV16C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1105940","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HVWV16C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HVWV16C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1105941,"name":"Custom Natural Bamboo Cutting Board Wedding or Engagement Gift, Personalized Your Text or Message (16x12 Inch, Wedding Date and Name, Classic)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91YsDV-1ZhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Personalize this 16 x 12 inch bamboo cutting board with your own text or name and wedding date as shown. We will laser engrave your name on the boards Da Vinci natural bamboo cutting boards are made of eco-friendly renewable natural bamboo offering a durable and attractive cutting surface for all your kitchen applications. No dyes or stains are used in this cutting board so the natural bamboo color will not fade or wash out. Please note that this board is 3/4 inch thick, whereas most other bamboo cutting boards are only 3/8” thick. There are 2 methods of cutting bamboo for manufacturing a cutting board: Horizontal cut or vertical cut. Once cut, the pieces are then pressed together to make a solid board. The boards that are made of vertically cut bamboo are much stronger and more durable than horizontally cut boards. All boards that are only 3/8” thick are made with horizontally cut bamboo, hence, they are cheaper. Horizontally cut bamboo can not be used to make thicker boards like our 3/4” thick board. The extra thick Da Vinci cutting boards are made with vertically cut bamboo making them considerably more durable than the competition. The board size is 16 x 12 inches. To care for bamboo cutting boards, do not soak them in water, do not use a dish washer. After every few uses, rub some vegetable oil or olive oil with a paper towel all over the board to make sure water does not get in to warp the board.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91YsDV-1ZhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DaVinci","source_asin":"B01BDV2I3G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1105941","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BDV2I3G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BDV2I3G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
